lain information about interests, hobbies and preferences in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking Someone to Repeat"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use modals of request like \"<span class=\"italic\">Would ...</span> \" and \"<span class=\"italic\">Can ...</span>\" and  these phrases to ask someone to repeat something:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Polite </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Casual </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm sorry, could you repeat that, please?<br />Would you say that again, please?<br/>Pardon me?<br />Can you repeat that, please?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Again, please?<br />Can you say that again?<br />What was that?<br />Come again?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Hobbies and Interests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "In warm seasons, like summer and spring, people have hobbies, and we can use the Simple Present tense to talk about them. "}, {"type": "text", "content": " For example: <br>I love gardening in the summer. <br> I go swimming on Sundays. <br> I enjoy surfing with my brother.<br> I go cycling regularly. <br> My friends would like to start bird-watching with me."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In cold seasons, like winter, people have hobbies like:<br />skiing <br />ice-skating <br />snowboarding"}, {"type": "text", "content": " "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wrong "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not correct"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That is the wrong answer. Try again."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you want to return something."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "right "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "correct "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: That is the right answer! Good work!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to realize "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to understand something you didn't know before "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I just realized that comic books are expensive!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to return "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take something back to a store "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to return this book - it's the wrong one."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "receipt "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a piece of paper that lists the things you buy at a store "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need the receipt to return an item at a store."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to exchange "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to return something at a store and get another thing to replace it "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can exchange the book for another one."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "return policy "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the rules for returning something to a store "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What is the return policy at the store?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to rip "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make a hole in clothing or paper "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Oh no, I ripped the book!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob03aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "amazing "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "excellent; fantastic "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The illustrations are amazing!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le02ob03aud09"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le02ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a short dialogue (5-6 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask the clerk about their return policy."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask them to repeat what they say."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Practice the dialogue with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a short dialogue in a store setting."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask for repetition."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask about a return policy."}]}], "type": "sena"}